{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/18044","id":4559554863,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABD8VJLw","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18044","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18044.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18044.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/18044","number":18044,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix ISR routes using undocumented $0 token in Vercel route dest fields","user":{"login":"astro-factory[bot]","id":316791938,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOEuHcgg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44914786?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-factory%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Changes\n\n- Replaces `$0` with `$1` in ISR route `dest` fields by wrapping each route's `src` regex in an outer capture group (e.g. `^/foo/?$` → `^(/foo/?)$`). `$0` is excluded from Vercel's documented substitution character class (`[1-9a-zA-Z]`); when the production proxy intermittently failed to substitute it, the literal string `\"$0\"` was silently accepted by the entrypoint, resolved to pathname `/$0`, and — with `trailingSlash: 'always'` — emitted a cacheable `301` redirect that poisoned the ISR cache for the full expiration window.\n- Adds a `realPath.startsWith('/')` guard in the entrypoint as defense in depth. Any future substitution failure now results in the request falling through to the `/_isr` default instead of silently rendering a nonsense path.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Two new tests in `packages/integrations/vercel/test/isr.test.ts`: `'uses $1 (not $0) in ISR route dest'` verifies the generated `config.json` no longer contains `$0`; `'ignores x_astro_path that does not start with /'` covers the entrypoint guard for un-substituted path values.\n\n## Docs\n\n- No docs update needed; this is an internal adapter implementation detail with no user-facing API change.\n\nCloses #18028","created_at":"2026-09-17T14:24:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T17:21:40Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T17:21:38Z","merged_at":"2026-09-17T17:21:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"98c07e1735b2c9e075ad31aeafa5af7db4bf0563","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10953064681,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAACjNqA6Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/fix%20verified","name":"fix verified","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Reporter confirmed the triage bot fix works","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/18044/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/18044/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github